{'symbol': 'IPG', 'date': '2022-06-08 20:00:00', 'title': 'JACK MORTON APPOINTS NEW MANAGING DIRECTOR OF ASIA', 'text': "PHIL BOYLE REJOINS AGENCY TO OVERSEE ASIAN OPERATIONS SINGAPORE , JUNE 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JACK MORTON , THE GLOBAL BRAND EXPERIENCE AGENCY TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BOLSTERED THE LEADERSHIP OF ITS OPERATION IN ASIA WITH THE APPOINTMENT OF PHIL BOYLE AS SVP, MANAGING DIRECTOR. BOYLE, WHO WILL BE BASED IN SINGAPORE AT THE AGENCY'S ASIA HEADQUARTERS, WILL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR DRIVING GROWTH ACROSS THE ENTIRE REGION."}